#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS Interrupt Controller
#  File: interrupt_controller.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS interrupt controller responsible for:
#      • IRQ registration
#      • interrupt masking
#      • ISR dispatch
#      • priority-based interrupt handling
#      • interrupt telemetry
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [IRQ Registration](ca://s?q=Explain_IRQ_Registration)
#    - [Interrupt Masking](ca://s?q=Explain_Interrupt_Masking)
#    - [ISR Dispatch](ca://s?q=Explain_ISR_Dispatch)
#    - [Priority Handling](ca://s?q=Explain_Interrupt_Priority)
#    - [Interrupt Telemetry](ca://s?q=Explain_Interrupt_Telemetry)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - register_irq(irq, handler, priority)
#         Registers interrupt vector entry.
#
#    - mask(irq)
#         Masks interrupt.
#
#    - unmask(irq)
#         Unmasks interrupt.
#
#    - dispatch(irq, payload)
#         Executes interrupt handler.
#
#    - highest_priority_irq()
#         Returns highest priority IRQ.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Returns interrupt controller state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  VECTOR TABLE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "irq": 5,
#      "handler": <async callable>,
#      "priority": 3,
#      "timestamp": <epoch>
#    }
#
#===============================================================================
#  RELATED MODULES:
